stic redwoods, or to lapping waves by a pristine white sand beach.\n\nBring peace, joy, and calm back into your daily life with Breathe VR Now in 5k\n\n\u2013 ENVIRONMENTS \u2013\n100+ lush environments to escape the every day.\n\n\u2013 MINDFULNESS \u2013\n20+ hours of guided meditations in Zen, Loving Compassion, Maternity, Depression, or Sleep.\n\n\u2013 CALMING MUSIC \u2013\n50+ relaxing audio tracks designed to enhance your meditation experience.", "short_description": "Bring peace, joy, and calm back into your daily life with Breathe VR Now in 5k\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://urban.health/vr-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://urban.health/vr-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Urban Health Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.urban.health/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1994410120759604"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_707432327227503_987342260190514898_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xGQKlYgIIpkQ7kNvwEHAuTt&_nc_oc=AdnEFKDD8yDh_8E1cdvQZOmk83Rfr0M1qet5qB121bzFSCbi7WO8dyj7J3fZy0Bb8jw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu6GPU0eTppaca3vhEkzMfVMX7wfAfoad1eonDGcB9KSQ&oe=699F042D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test